<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak Oct real ind output +3.6 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Slovak Oct real ind output +3.6 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slovak real industrial output rose 3.6 percent year-on-year in October, after a revised year-on-year increase of 3.1 percent in September, the Slovak Statistical Bureau (SUSR) said on Wednesday.  </p>
<p> SLOVAK INDUSTRIAL OUTPUT    Oct 96    Sept 96	Oct 95</p>
<p>  pct change yr/yr		+3.6    +3.1 (+1.9)   +12.8</p>
<p>Construction Output</p>
<p>  pct change yr/yr		+4.4    +6.2 (+5.8)    +7.9</p>
<p>Note: The SUSR has revised figures for September industrial production and construction output. The original figures are in brackets. All figures are subject to revision.</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 42-7-563-3687</p>
</text>
